 eedom Trail Committee-Saturday\, September 19\, 2026\, from 5:30a.m. – 8
 :30am- starting point: Archer Memorial A.M.E. Zion Church\, 320 Hayden Sta
 tion Road\, Windsor. This year marks the 30th anniversary of the Windsor F
